  "doctrine": {
    "summary": "Compact defence force shaped by the 2008 war with Russia, which still occupies Abkhazia and South Ossetia. Long NATO-partner experience (Iraq, Afghanistan) left US-style small-unit training and M4-pattern kit alongside Soviet-legacy armour and artillery. Since 2024 the Georgian Dream government has frozen the EU accession process and cooled relations with Western partners while keeping no diplomatic relations with Moscow, so alignment is in flux.",
    "squad_size": 9,
    "fireteam": "US-style 9-man squad: leader plus two 4-man fireteams.",
