  "notes": "Neutral-to-friendly to the player: still a NATO partner with Western training and US kit, but political ties with the West cooled sharply in 2024-2026, so contract volume and trade could be lower than other partners (proposal). Abkhazia and South Ossetia are Russian-occupied; Russian forces there use the rus faction. Georgian volunteers fight for Ukraine independently of the government. Real-world: Georgia uses HMMWV and some US-supplied MRAPs, not Abrams, Bradley or AH-1Z. PKM fires 7.62x54R and can disable vehicles in game.",
